title: ReflectOnDuty
---
Prince: Duty is simple when the road is clear. It is harder when every choice asks something different of me.
===

title: ReflectOnFamily
---
Prince: Family can be a shelter and a weight at once. I wonder which part I am carrying today.
===

title: ReflectOnFaith
---
Prince: Faith is not only what I say when I am certain. Perhaps it matters most when certainty leaves me.
===

title: ReflectOnFuture
---
Prince: I keep trying to see the whole road ahead. Maybe I only need enough light for the next step.
===

title: ReflectOnFear
---
Prince: Fear speaks quickly and calls itself wisdom. I should listen carefully before I obey it.
===

title: ReflectOnMercy
---
Prince: Mercy is easy to praise from a distance. The real question is whether I can choose it when I feel wronged.
===
